# Fixture source crates/projects under src/ (see README.md).
# Lockfiles are committed: each fixture crate is a standalone leaf artifact
# (own `[workspace]`), overriding hypen-engine-rs/.gitignore's `Cargo.lock`.
!src/*/Cargo.lock

# Build output (the built .wasm is copied up into this dir and force-added).
src/*/target/
src/*/node_modules/
src/*/dist/
src/*/bun.lock
src/go-module/internal/bindings/
src/go-module/go.sum
src/go-module/app.wasm
